menu "Keystone brain"

    config KS_STATUS_LED_GPIO
        int "GPIO for the on-board status WS2812"
        default 21
        help
            The on-board addressable (WS2812) status LED.
            - 21 on the Waveshare ESP32-S3-Zero (the original brain board);
            - 48 on the ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 v1.1 / WeAct Core S3 (N16R8 boards).

endmenu
